ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a pet store, customer Xiao Zhang is choosing pet birds. He tells the store owner Xiao Li, \"There are 50 birds here, most of them are parrots, some are pigeons, but there are hardly any sparrows.\" Xiao Li counts and finds there are only 12 pigeons.\n\n[Question]\nBefore Xiao Li counts, how many parrots does he guess there are?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Li counts, he guesses there are 25 parrots.\nB. Before Xiao Li counts, he guesses there are 45 parrots.\nC. Before Xiao Li counts, he guesses there are 49 parrots.\nD. Before Xiao Li counts, he guesses there are 50 parrots.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001501135531962824,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e17ad6006945d27ff7ec","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367866638,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9d05da874a40463eadf7b47cb468c8a7"}